How my code runs ?

Java Developement Kit -----> Java Runtime Environment ------> Java Virtual Machine 

1) Compilation : sourcecode(.java) goes to the compiler, and converts it into byte code (.class) 
          [PORTABLE LANGUAGE] can executed on any system 
2) Execution : byte code (.class) with the help of JVM converts it into native code

source code ----> byte code -----> native code
        [COMPILATION]        JVM       [EXECUTION]
